{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/extras/en.png?t=1744248487\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't forget to wishlist the full game Horror Simulator VR to continue your most thrilling exorcism journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete special holiday tasks to win exclusive rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/extras/0.gif?t=1744248487\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Solo/Co-Op Adventure in Haunted Mansion</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo or 3-player co-op. Real-time voice chat allows you to stay in close communication with your teammates, share clues, and devise strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize avatar: Unlock a variety of masks, skins, and decorations. Cosmetics designs are player-driven - join Discord to share your ideas!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/extras/1.gif?t=1744248487\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd78 Immersive Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ demon types, each with unique personality and behavior. Every round features a new demon, ensures every playthrough brings fresh challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use 7 sacramentals to to solve challenging puzzles and reveal the demon\u2019s name.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ unique, fully interactive rooms. Each exploration may uncover crucial clues or trigger unexpected supernatural events!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/extras/2.gif?t=1744248487\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc3 Classic &amp; Crazy Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons will do everything to scare you off. When your sanity plummets, demons will initiate hunt mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Crazy Mode, demons possess special abilities, making teamwork and strategy crucial for victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/extras/demon.gif?t=1744248487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dare to venture forth?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3194220?t=1744248487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/17c5631c226189cbc771ee074238ba85c56e0867/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744248487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/a6979fad2e596e129cf555d8c8f1eb8ac7ce1852/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744248487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/a6979fad2e596e129cf555d8c8f1eb8ac7ce1852/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744248487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/extras/en.png?t=1744248487\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't forget to wishlist the full game Horror Simulator VR to continue your most thrilling exorcism journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete special holiday tasks to win exclusive rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194220/extras/0.gif?t=1744248487\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><h2